{"content_html": "<html><body><div>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"1786868918714_1491956690398542899_2995255404741321750_87bcedd47393d8f85e0c9a254d717306.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/16/1786868918714-1491956690398542899-2995255404741321750-87bcedd47393d8f85e0c9a254d717306-1052.jpg?width=0&amp;s=CzEJJ1YLLF_YDOvA6VGrWw\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption><a href=\"https://vietnamnet.vn/van-hoa-giai-tri/the-gioi-sao\">Sao Việt</a> 16/8: Những ngày qua, ca sĩ Quang Lê cùng anh trai đang tổ chức đám tang cho mẹ tại Mỹ. Anh trân trọng mọi sự sẻ chia từ đồng nghiệp, người quen và khán giả. </figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"776640006_18611559208021451_5211490297627003161_n.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/16/776640006-18611559208021451-5211490297627003161-n-1053.jpg?width=0&amp;s=C-9XtEISJ3mdEWQmaJMqgQ\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"776640006_18611559208021451_5211490297627003161_n.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/16/776640006-18611559208021451-5211490297627003161-n-1054.jpg?width=0&amp;s=3RSebFC9eZGl7Pto6OhLUw\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>Ca sĩ Nguyễn Trần Trung Quân vừa biểu diễn tại chương trình nghệ thuật chính luận \"81 mùa bình yên\". Anh đăng ảnh thân thiết bên danh hài Quang Thắng. Đáng chú ý, tên anh đang bất ngờ được tìm kiếm nhiều trên google. </figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"777825436_2531594894012504_2323015699709908667_n.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/16/777825436-2531594894012504-2323015699709908667-n-1055.jpg?width=0&amp;s=RH_cz7Q029P86aUeZpQIsw\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>\n<figure>\n<div>\n<div><picture><img alt=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/16/ca-si-quang-le-chiu-tang-me-ca-si-nguyen-tran-trung-quan-gay-chu-y-1056.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/16/ca-si-quang-le-chiu-tang-me-ca-si-nguyen-tran-trung-quan-gay-chu-y-1056.jpg?width=0&amp;s=74njdvD_kcwsWpAq9K3VSg\"/></picture></div>\n<div><picture><img alt=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/16/tangmyhan3-1057.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/16/tangmyhan3-1057.jpg?width=0&amp;s=4QHRXPfgBEHQIrQugHYyqQ\"/></picture></div>\n</div>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure>\nHot girl Tăng Mỹ Hàn - bạn gái rapper HIEUTHUHAI - xinh xắn, ngọt ngào.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"773291133_1063335309538959_3549413599131698946_n.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/16/773291133-1063335309538959-3549413599131698946-n-1058.jpg?width=0&amp;s=tZ_3Lj9deAhtnLaG79tplA\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>MC Khánh Vy cá tính.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"1786868918714_1491956690398542899_2995255404741321750_87bcedd47393d8f85e0c9a254d717306.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/16/1786868918714-1491956690398542899-2995255404741321750-87bcedd47393d8f85e0c9a254d717306-1059.jpg?width=0&amp;s=Tv5x7arACOjn8N0ZVMmIbQ\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>Diễn viên Võ Điền Gia Huy \"thả thính\" fan.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"773985668_10163644431302799_5231685325338232137_n.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/16/773985668-10163644431302799-5231685325338232137-n-1060.jpg?width=0&amp;s=0uWuABa_wi6UHUoSZP9MBw\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>Diễn viên Lan Phương hóa cô gái vùng cao.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"774836363_986046874460464_4376644017508706588_n.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/16/774836363-986046874460464-4376644017508706588-n-1061.jpg?width=0&amp;s=YFQmWotUqa_0j9zgUW_-0Q\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>Nghệ sĩ Việt Hương bình thản đối diện những công kích mạng.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"775096952_1604409794384448_8151650288845770187_n.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/16/775096952-1604409794384448-8151650288845770187-n-1062.jpg?width=0&amp;s=0ZABhMi6OLcpYTMpVZ7R4Q\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>Ca sĩ Trịnh Thăng Bình trẻ trung tuổi U40.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"776578651_1806784386990377_4471595494596393787_n.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/8/16/776578651-1806784386990377-4471595494596393787-n-1063.jpg?width=0&amp;s=YwG2jivtygdR6M9YA2epIA\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>Người đẹp Quỳnh Anh Shyn quyến rũ.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><sou